_{X}\\times {S}_{Y},$ which contains the joint support. Let's also consider a point $(x,y)$ where $x<1$ and $y<0,$ and a region $Δ$ that lies below and to the left of this point.\n\n![](images/8e/8edc6bb45750996ba8d84bf946eaf4de6c68c0f3074ab7af4bee2b68c48c2095.png)\n\nSince every value in the support of $X$ is at least $1$ and $x<1,$ no possible value of $X$ satisfies $X\\le x.$ Also, every value in the support of $Y$ is at least $1$ and $y<0,$ so no possible value of $Y$ satisfies $Y\\le y.$\n\nTherefore, there are no points in the joint support that lie in the region $Δ,$ and\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=P(X\\le x,Y\\le y)=0.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519571 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162130 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "20b8dd2d-ecaa-58bf-baa3-72dc8f37523f" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Joint CDF Geometrically"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04dfb568-d3f2-577e-a17b-4e8945397f61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{xy}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518994} {:answer/id #uuid "12429b67-5b86-5c17-8419-77c0ae4af158" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519020} {:answer/id #uuid "2e5dace1-05de-551d-aaba-34d7c9148ba5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519066} {:answer/id #uuid "938876b8-e60e-5abf-9a3b-15a2bc68a965" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519237} {:answer/id #uuid "ff7d0599-e6ed-56d0-8e96-9f13414d8a7d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519412}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2e5dace1-05de-551d-aaba-34d7c9148ba5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :an